OL,3,GNEWSAControversial incinerator plans
OL,4,Aapproved on appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to build an
OL,7,Fincinerator have been approved
OL,8,Ffollowing an appeal.
OL,10,FThe Planning Inspectorate allowed MVV
OL,11,FEnvironment Ltd's appeal over the
OL,12,Fenergy-from-waste facility at Canford
OL,13,FResource Park, off Magna Road, in
OL,14,FPoole, on Tuesday, overturning a
OL,15,Frefusal from Bournemouth, Christchurch
OL,16,Fand Poole (BCP) Council.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
